<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Agent-ScanKit: Unraveling Memory and Reasoning of Multimodal Agents via Sensitivity Perturbations</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
